    "created_at": "2024-08-23T09:38:22Z",
    "updated_at": "2024-08-23T09:38:40Z",
    "body": "They do not accept arrays. JavaScript just converts `[\"foo\", \"bar\", \"baz\"]` to the string `foo,bar,baz` which percent-encodes to `foo%2Cbar%2Cbaz`.",
