    "updated_at": "2024-08-23T09:38:34Z",
    "body": "This is documented although not in the sense you would expect.\r\n\r\nThe second argument of `set()` is of type `USVString` as per https://url.spec.whatwg.org/#interface-urlsearchparams which per step 1 of https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#js-USVString means that through some indirection https://tc39.es/ecma262/multipage/abstract-operations.html#sec-tostring gets invoked on the value passed as second argument. Which is what you are observing.",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
